                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I sent a letter to Acting-IRS Commissioner Krause requesting the revocation of New Georgia Project\u2019s tax-exempt status.\n\nThe project\u2019s founder, Stacey Abrams, utilized the organization\u2019s beneficial tax treatment to prop up her failed 2018 Gubernatorial Campaign.\n\nOur tax code should not be awarding Georgia\u2019s Grifter-in-Chief beneficial treatment for this organization to act as an arm of the Georgia Democratic Party.",
