                "retweet_count": 33,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When the Democrats were in power, they passed the Inflation Reduction Act, which was packed with handouts to the wealthy and well-connected, created a slush fund of revenue to China, and gave preferential tax treatment to green virtue-signaling on luxury cars and home improvements.\n\nThe One, Big, Beautiful Bill puts an end to all of this and saves billions in taxpayer dollars.",
