                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "President Trump\u2019s trade deal with Indonesia is a big win for American farmers and our economy. Between 2020-2024, the United States went from a $450 million agricultural trade surplus to a $1.1 billion deficit with Indonesia. This deal commands fair treatment for American farmers and will rein that trade deficit in.\n\nPresident Trump promised to defend American producers from discriminatory trade practices and this trade deal is another example of him delivering on that promise.",
