                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At the Missouri State Fair, I had the opportunity to speak with representatives of the Missouri Dairy Association.\n\nWe discussed how President Trump\u2019s Liberation Day tariffs have been a game changer for American dairy producers, forcing fairer treatment in global markets. Specifically, we discussed Canada\u2019s discrimination against American dairy products and how I, in Congress, can work alongside President Trump to support his mission of making global markets fair again.",
